# cards-gpu: what the two GPU cards (perf_card.py, rk78_card.py) import, plus the build
# backends the editable installs need (--no-build-isolation). CPython 3.12, Linux x86_64.
# CUDA runtime: 12.6 (PyTorch cu126 wheels and the nvidia-*-cu12 12.6 libraries they pin,
# shared by CuPy and JAX); JAX compiles with ptxas 12.9 to SASS. No PTX JIT on the timed paths.
# Driver floor: >= 525.60.13 (CUDA 12 minor-version compatibility); tested on 560.35.
# A driver older than ptxas 12.9 only makes XLA warn and compile serially.
# GPU floor: compute capability 6.0 (cupy, warp, eagle, hawk); the PyTorch and JAX
# wheels' sm_60 coverage is expected but has not been run on a P100 here.
--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu126
